  Class: 19
  Name: Wrasse
  Description: Two seats, one hull, like a cleaner wrasse and the grouper it keeps clean.
    One player flies the Grouper, the hull; the other flies the Wrasse, a kite on the hull's
    own plane - its head picks enemy prisms off, its tail lassos motes into blasts, prism
    clusters, saved boosts and crystal rams. D-pad left or right swaps seats; the AI takes
    the empty one.
